      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "for (int r -> n)\n    int x = str[r];\n    count ( x - 'a')++;\nif count of (a || b ) > k \n    --> shrink window L++ \n    --> reduce count(l -'a')--;\n    if ( count (0) < count (1) )\n            a < b\n        if (count(0) > k)\n            ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "for (int r -> n)\n    int x = str[r];\n    count ( x - 'a')++;\nif count of (a || b ) > k \n    --> shrink window L++ \n    --> reduce count(l -'a')--;\n    if ( count (0) < count (1) )\n            a < b\n        if (count(0) > k)\n            ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
