      "updated": 1772015600673,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": " a[0]   a[1]   a[2]   ...    a[L]   ...   ...   ...  ...  ...  ...   a[R] \n |------ prefix[L-1] ------|---- subarray ----|\n |--------------------------- prefix[R] ---------------------------|\n \nprefix[R] - prefix[L-1] = k\n\n⇔ prefix[L-1] = prefix[R] - k  ← we look this up\n⇔ targetPrefixSum = currentPrefixSum - k;  ← we look this up\n⇔ PrefixSum = Sum - k;\n\nif sum - k is seen in PrefixSum Map \nwe calculate\n\nPrefixMap[PresfixSum] + 1 = L \ni = R\nthen , PrefixMap[sum] - ",
      "fontSize": 17.977455499568055,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": " a[0]   a[1]   a[2]   ...    a[L]   ...   ...   ...  ...  ...  ...   a[R] \n |------ prefix[L-1] ------|---- subarray ----|\n |--------------------------- prefix[R] ---------------------------|\n \nprefix[R] - prefix[L-1] = k\n\n⇔ prefix[L-1] = prefix[R] - k  ← we look this up\n⇔ targetPrefixSum = currentPrefixSum - k;  ← we look this up\n⇔ PrefixSum = Sum - k;\n\nif sum - k is seen in PrefixSum Map \nwe calculate\n\nPrefixMap[PresfixSum] + 1 = L \ni = R\nthen , PrefixMap[sum] - ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
